⍝ Send sample orders to the "orders" topic.
⍝   kafka.sh run demo/produce-orders.apls [count] [first-id]   (default 20 1)
args←2⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'
num←{0=≢⍵:⍺ ⋄ ⊃⊃(//⎕VFI ⍵)}
n←20 num{1<≢⍵:2⊃⍵ ⋄ ''}args
first←1 num{2<≢⍵:3⊃⍵ ⋄ ''}args
home←{0=≢⍵:'/app/integrations/kafka' ⋄ ⍵}2⎕NQ'.' 'GetEnvironment' 'DYALOG_KAFKA_HOME'
brokers←{0=≢⍵:'apl-kafka:19092' ⋄ ⍵}2⎕NQ'.' 'GetEnvironment' 'KAFKA_BROKERS'
{}⎕FIX'file://',home,'/apl/Kafka.apln'
{}⎕FIX'file://',home,'/apl/Orders.apln'

p←Kafka.Producer brokers
orders←first Orders.Make n
⍝ Key = region: all of a region's orders go to the same partition, in order
{p Kafka.Send'orders'⍵ ⍵.region}¨orders
(ok bad)←Kafka.Flush p
⎕←'Sent ',(⍕ok),' orders (ids ',(⍕first),'–',(⍕first+n-1),'), ',(⍕bad),' failed.'
⎕OFF 0≠bad
